# Exclude every local financial source. The hosted build receives application
# source plus the empty-shell generator, never statements or generated exports.
Scotiabank 2026 e-statements/
Tangerine/
amex/
BMO/
.claude/
*.py
*.db
*.pdf
*.md
expense-dashboard.html
/favicon.svg

# Hosted statement-import function and its shared parsers.
!api/
!api/**/*.py
!ingest.py
!build_dashboard.py
!Tangerine/
Tangerine/*
!Tangerine/normalize_tangerine.py
!requirements.txt
!.python-version
